            <ArticleTitle>Type 2 fiber predominance in muscle cramp and exertional myalgia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>563-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In patients complaining of muscle cramps and exertional myalgia, we found a significant decrease of type 1 muscle fiber proportion in comparison with a control group. The possible mechanism of this change is discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
